{
 "encounter_id": "00703",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Afternoon. My ankles swell by evening. Been going on a month. I thought I'd mention it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Both ankles, or one?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Both. Worse after a day on my feet, gone by the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any breathlessness, or waking at night short of breath? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Nothing like that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What tablets do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 10 mg once a day. And omeprazole, 20 mg once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long have you been on the 10 mg? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About six weeks. They put it up from five. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's useful to know. Let's check you over. Pulse, pressure and so on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go ahead. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 74, blood pressure 130 over 80, temperature 36.6, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 14 a minute.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that okay? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's fine. Up on the couch, and let me press on your ankles. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It leaves a dent, doesn't it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, there's mild swelling around both ankles, and it dents when I press. Your calves are soft and not tender.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it my heart? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nothing I've found points to that, and your lungs are clear. I'm not going to put a name on it today. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. What do we do? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Put your feet up in the evenings, above hip height if you can, and don't sit with your legs crossed for long."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I sit all day at work, mind. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take a walk at lunchtime, and get up every hour. Compression socks can help, too. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do you want me to stop anything? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not today. Let's see how it settles with the leg raising. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And if it doesn't? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And if one leg swells much more than the other, or becomes hot and painful, come in the same day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Understood. Thanks. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take care. ~"
  }
 ],
